codex
A larger possible optimization is algebraic: combine input LayerNorm with the five input projections, computing the projection from raw input plus per-row mean/rstd instead of materializing normalized `x`. I’m first testing the numerical margin in PyTorch before deciding whether it is worth implementing in Triton.
