codex
The BF16-normalized plus FP32-accumulated `out_gate` path gives a middle ground for C=128 N=512/1024: slower than fully packed, but much faster than full FP32 layernorm and with better numerical margin. I’m patching C=128 to use fully packed only for the known safe B=1,N=768 case.
